Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.31,0:00:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：寻找七处遗迹的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现在我们面前的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与精灵 玛哈的决斗开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这场决斗 鲨鱼他们的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被那家伙告知 也赌上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 纳修
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会救你的！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！ 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.81,0:00:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击守备怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)门！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(玛哈)曾经的英雄说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此的羁绊会为彼此开辟新的道路。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.09,0:00:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动德鲁伊·维德的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于这只怪兽被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.35,0:00:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌 发动永续魔法决断的迷宫！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我将２张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 不公平条约。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)那两张卡是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)什么!? 这次是上面吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《如果能发挥原本的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这里逃脱也是可能的…》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.97,0:01:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！ 我我我魔导女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对那家伙 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一瞬间 两张卡将你们逼入绝境！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决断的迷宫效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方玩家攻击时战斗结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.71,0:01:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我支付600生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方玩家的1张手牌送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.86,0:01:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 发动永续陷阱 不公平条约。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 自己永续魔法的发动效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我必须支付生命值的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那部分生命值就由你来支付。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 他的目标是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 快点把手牌弃掉吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.14,0:02:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 我把1张卡送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 破坏我们手牌和生命值的连招。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我们来说算是试炼吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我们的试炼……》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((马哈德：彼此的羁绊会为彼此开辟新的道路))
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！ 也就是说通过我们发动攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼们的门就会打开吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的连招是，只要我们发动攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值就会被削减。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，如果不发动攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没法拯救鲨鱼们。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.47,0:02:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，这个试炼你要怎么闯过去？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个试炼，你要怎么闯过去？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么试炼啊！开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的嘎嘎嘎魔法师和
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎小子叠放，超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.39 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是你的 No.卡吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.44,0:05:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤暗跃的德鲁伊·德律阿斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地里的1只德鲁伊怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.01,0:05:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！暗跃的德鲁伊·维德！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，就让你见识一下我的 No.卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4的德鲁伊·德鲁伊斯和维德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.44！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}悠久的大义啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻正是从远古的沉眠中苏醒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化作翱翔天空的翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}白天马 天空·珀伽索斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了啊，No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张 No.卡将赐予你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全新的试炼。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动天空·珀伽索斯的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方场上的1只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要破坏的是 希望皇 霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你可以通过支付500生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来使这个效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又要扣我的生命值吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 一旦失去霍普 就没法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救出鲨鱼他们了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我支付500点生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让霍普的破坏无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一刻 天空·天马
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的另一个效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方支付生命值时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个数值的伤害给予对方。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去 生命值会不断被削减的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些 No.里也有连招。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个接一个到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙，这边游马的决斗开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然冒出了 No.精灵。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.精灵？ 这家伙是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼，给你们设下的陷阱和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗是联动的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们一攻击那边的门就会打开。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是一旦攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}削减我们生命的连招就会发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 竟然把我们当成了累赘。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我，鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会救你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此被迫分离的时候才正是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其真正价值受到考验之时。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}分离……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夏克。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你们所在的地方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有没有什么能成为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:07:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗线索的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的线索？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 发生什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 那是壁画吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他给我们设下的试炼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一种解谜游戏。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我们像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被分开这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是试炼的开始的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在夏克他们所在的地方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该会有解开谜题的线索。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙 那幅壁画上画着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}画着什么啊好像是画和文字之类的东西……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这上面 记载着关于
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.71,0:08:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古代英雄的传说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你能看懂那玩意儿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传说是这样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很久以前 有一个国家侍奉着勇敢的骑士们。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其中一人 骑着爱马天马是位英雄。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英雄率领的骑士们大显身手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护着那个国家的和平。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有一次 英雄离开了城堡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回到了自己出生的故乡村庄。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.39,0:09:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 英雄不在了之后留下的骑士们当中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.36,0:09:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有人想打倒国王夺取国家的人出现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们在英雄离去之后对自己的力量自负{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始宣称自己才是配得上王位的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座遗迹的传说究竟想告诉我们什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传说只记载到那里为止。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.27,0:09:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧推进决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕要削减我们的生命值也要救出鲨鱼他们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.65,0:09:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏敌人的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.01,0:09:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望皇霍普攻击天空·天马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 阴谋之盾。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为自己怪兽的装备卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽处于攻击表示时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次 将战斗伤害变为零{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续魔法 决断的迷宫与{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 不公平条约的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你的生命值减少600{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且还要将1张手牌丢弃到墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 天空·天马的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方支付生命值的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方那个数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 那个房间里的壁画后续呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 有了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}后续是这样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得知骑士们谋反的英雄{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶到了城堡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后英雄向他们倾诉道。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论何时都希望他们回想起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心中高举的正义，以及并肩作战的同伴之间的羁绊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}曾经的同伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却向英雄举起了刀刃。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英雄无法对同伴挥剑。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他毫不抵抗，被同伴的剑所伤，倒下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那时。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爱马 佩加索斯{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了守护主人，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.43,0:11:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挡在了骑士们面前。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它不惜牺牲自己，也要保护英雄。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}于是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那后来怎么样了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾，到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这之后已经风化，没法再读下去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么会。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是什么感觉……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我好像知道这个传说一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道……为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我曾经来过这里吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将一张天空·珀伽索斯的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.37,0:12:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，你可以支付500生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来无效这个效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，考验的时刻到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，再被削减生命值的话，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗就赢不了了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管我们了。把霍普破坏掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 你要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:13:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付500来守住霍普还是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守住霍普 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 别胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.10,0:13:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道这个传说的后续。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英雄无法舍弃帕伽索斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他做不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他留在了原地，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与帕伽索斯一同咽下了最后一口气。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还不明白吗！这个传说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}讲述的是守护同伴以及相信他人的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.63,0:13:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 守住霍普 相信我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 为什么要这么做。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.75,0:13:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋是 德鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.69,0:14:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 别信这家伙说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.29,0:14:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 那家伙是巴利安！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)游马你还想重蹈覆辙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((来救我 辛苦你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马巡查！ ))
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你要相信什么就交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.49,0:15:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 试着跨越这场试炼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天空·天马啊 破坏霍普吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我愿付出生命把霍普的破坏无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一刻，天空·帕伽索斯的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对手支付生命值的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予其相应数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，我们的生命值就只剩200了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.05,0:15:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来是这么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.85,0:15:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你这家伙为什么要听这家伙的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼我果然还是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法怀疑他。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不想怀疑任何人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了。我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.93,0:16:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，他的连招已经崩溃了。攻击吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然有点搞不太明白
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但既然是你说的，那就上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用霍普攻击天空·珀伽索斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 阴谋之盾 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于决断的迷宫你要将1张手牌送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.97,0:16:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将1张卡送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.94,0:16:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来游马受到600点伤害就输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系 游马的话绝对。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都没发生？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的 combo 已经不会再发动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来他的 combo通过决断的迷宫{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己必须支付的 cost{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过不公平条约 由我们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不得不支付。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 由于保护了霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}免受天空·珀伽索斯的效果影响{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的生命值变成200了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让他成立 combo 的条件{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经低于600点了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然我们已经没有生命值可以支付{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.23,0:17:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那生命值 就得由他自己来支付了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的选择是正确的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然这样我就把刚才送去墓地的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱 超级快攻 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡从手牌送去墓地时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽1张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那张是魔法卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就当作速攻魔法使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 这就是命运的抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来个闪亮抽卡 我！ 抽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让1只超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将阶级4的希望皇霍普重叠！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.69,0:18:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀着希望的灵魂啊网罗森罗万象{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.23,0:18:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为引导未来的力量吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.31,0:18:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷·胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动霍普雷·胜利的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力加到自己攻击力上！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利·充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！希望剑·胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 双重胜利斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢…赢了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们挺过了试炼。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马哈 那个侍奉英雄的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帕伽索斯 指的就是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 传说还有后续。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骑士们被拼上性命的英雄与帕伽索斯打动了内心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为自己的行为感到羞耻谋反的心思就此消失无踪。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(马哈)他们将英雄与帕伽索斯厚葬{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.23,0:20:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在墓前屈膝跪地深深地低下了头。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而后英雄与帕伽索斯的灵魂一同
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.51,0:20:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被召往了天国。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是传说的全部。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光体 就让我试试
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.01,0:20:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们相信他人的力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.44。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.47,0:20:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，为什么要救我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}硬要说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是这个遗迹的传说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我心动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.05,0:20:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是你没告诉我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.51,0:20:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个传说的后续……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，这是你自己选择的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算不问那种东西也一定会相信人的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，这种玩笑话就到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.13,0:21:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次再见面的时候那时候就做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.41,0:21:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霸者的硬币。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.17,0:21:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.91,0:21:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在冒险过的地方 作为证明{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会留下这枚硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.51,0:21:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有这么个习惯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那果然爸爸他在这里……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.97,0:21:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 老爸他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.21,0:21:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直 都在某处{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.21,0:21:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护着我的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光鲨我一直在想。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.60,0:21:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安那些家伙 会利用我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信别人这一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 我终究没办法去怀疑别人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能选择相信别人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《如果那就是你的结论现在我就不多说什么了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕 因此 从今往后 你要和我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.52,0:22:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走上不同的道路……》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.37,0:23:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.80,0:23:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.07,0:23:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.38,0:23:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.27,0:23:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.79,0:23:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.61,0:23:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
